{"4891150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Fortune", "steam_appid": 4891150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Fortune Favours the Bold: a variety of combat footage of a small hero in padded armour cutting through enemies with different weapons, running through fantasy medieval dungeons and caves\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate for wealth, you cast yourself into the Well of Eternal Riches. A lifetime of treasures are now yours, if you can live long enough to escape its accursed depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a fast-paced action roguelite where survival demands <strong>increasingly powerful builds</strong>, and ever harsher sacrifices to achieve them. Battle through the Well’s accursed depths, shape uniquely formed Relics into devastating combinations, and decide how much of your newfound fortune you’re willing to gamble on making it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/5b09a6bc3b11bdde1e295537956e0cff.avif?t=1788262879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/5b09a6bc3b11bdde1e295537956e0cff.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>relentless enemies</strong>, deadly contraptions and the burden of your own greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dodge, strike and ability matters as the temple evolves around you and the <strong>challenge escalates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn fast. Adapt faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Master the Chaos: a variety of geometric objects being rotated and arranged on a grid-like board, visual effects flourishing from proximity to one another\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are your key to becoming wildly, unfathomably <strong>powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>geometrically shaped power-up</strong> can be collected and combined to forge fresh strategies, amplify neighbouring effects and unleash devastating chain reactions. Move one Relic and your entire build can burst into life, or crumble apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment. Augment. Overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/e149b10189333ff5b5fa64293991ec95.avif?t=1788262879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/e149b10189333ff5b5fa64293991ec95.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temple grows wise to your escape, and <strong>no two paths will ever be the same</strong>. Its sprawling underworld of chambers, combatants and choices force you to rethink your strategy with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody an array of desperate hopefuls, each with their own abilities and pitfalls. Relics overlooked in one run may better serve a <strong>new master</strong> in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Well calls to all who hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Risk Everything\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every setback brings the temple closer to reclaiming its prize. Will you protect your precious fortune, spend it to improve your chances, or gamble it all in pursuit of greater power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/ad22d6b2457a686af91e242d7839b0f5.avif?t=1788262879\" alt=\"Claim your Rogue Fortune\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/ad22d6b2457a686af91e242d7839b0f5.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your fate. Master the temple. Escape with whatever remains. Will your greed consume you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rogue Fortune is in active development, so be sure to WISHLIST NOW and never miss a beat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowmade is an independent game studio based in Guildford, UK, creating bold, original games built around expansive play and memorable shared experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Official Community Discord and never adventure alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Fortune Favours the Bold: a variety of combat footage of a small hero in padded armour cutting through enemies with different weapons, running through fantasy medieval dungeons and caves\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/33d45bb29ab0ff6905def9c17eba4a9e.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate for wealth, you cast yourself into the Well of Eternal Riches. A lifetime of treasures are now yours, if you can live long enough to escape its accursed depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a fast-paced action roguelite where survival demands <strong>increasingly powerful builds</strong>, and ever harsher sacrifices to achieve them. Battle through the Well’s accursed depths, shape uniquely formed Relics into devastating combinations, and decide how much of your newfound fortune you’re willing to gamble on making it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/5b09a6bc3b11bdde1e295537956e0cff.avif?t=1788262879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/5b09a6bc3b11bdde1e295537956e0cff.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>relentless enemies</strong>, deadly contraptions and the burden of your own greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dodge, strike and ability matters as the temple evolves around you and the <strong>challenge escalates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn fast. Adapt faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Master the Chaos: a variety of geometric objects being rotated and arranged on a grid-like board, visual effects flourishing from proximity to one another\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/2cd5bdf414cb20e47b6460d4cba7f7f1.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are your key to becoming wildly, unfathomably <strong>powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>geometrically shaped power-up</strong> can be collected and combined to forge fresh strategies, amplify neighbouring effects and unleash devastating chain reactions. Move one Relic and your entire build can burst into life, or crumble apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment. Augment. Overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/e149b10189333ff5b5fa64293991ec95.avif?t=1788262879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/e149b10189333ff5b5fa64293991ec95.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temple grows wise to your escape, and <strong>no two paths will ever be the same</strong>. Its sprawling underworld of chambers, combatants and choices force you to rethink your strategy with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embody an array of desperate hopefuls, each with their own abilities and pitfalls. Relics overlooked in one run may better serve a <strong>new master</strong> in the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Well calls to all who hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.poster.avif?t=1788262879\" aria-label=\"Risk Everything\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.webm?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/7e44cf35e89ca01cd58555a869560a8d.mp4?t=1788262879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every setback brings the temple closer to reclaiming its prize. Will you protect your precious fortune, spend it to improve your chances, or gamble it all in pursuit of greater power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras/ad22d6b2457a686af91e242d7839b0f5.avif?t=1788262879\" alt=\"Claim your Rogue Fortune\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891150/extras_big/ad22d6b2457a686af91e242d7839b0f5.webp?t=1788262879 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your fate. Master the temple. Escape with whatever remains. Will your greed consume you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rogue Fortune is in active development, so be sure to WISHLIST NOW and never miss a beat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowmade is an independent game studio based in Guildford, UK, creating bold, original games built around expansive play and memorable shared experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Official Community Discord and never adventure alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_